menu "MicClicker C3"

config MICCLICKER_ESPNOW_PROBE_SENDER
    bool "Run the ESP-NOW probe as the sender instead of the hardware selftest"
    default n
    help
        Replaces the G.722 / Wi-Fi / ADC selftest with the stage-3 ESP-NOW probe:
        discovery, burst audio, paced audio, key retransmission, pairing and an
        encrypted round trip. Pair with the S3 receiver probe on the same channel.

config MICCLICKER_ESPNOW_PROBE_CHANNEL
    int "ESP-NOW probe channel (2.4 GHz)"
    range 1 13
    default 1
    depends on MICCLICKER_ESPNOW_PROBE_SENDER
    help
        Both ends must use the same channel. The probe logs the channel it actually
        reached, so a mismatch shows up in the logs rather than only as silence.

endmenu
